s delivery in one research flow.</p></div><dl data-cstd-page-hero-metrics=\"true\" class=\"mt-10 grid max-w-4xl grid-cols-2 border-y border-white/20 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"border-white/15 py-4 pr-5 odd:border-r md:border-r md:last:border-r-0 md:px-5 md:first:pl-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#8a969b]\">valuation scenarios</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 whitespace-nowrap text-xl font-semibold text-[#24e0ff] sm:text-2xl\">3</dd></div><div class=\"border-white/15 py-4 pr-5 odd:border-r md:border-r md:last:border-r-0 md:px-5 md:first:pl-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#8a969b]\">forecast period</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 whitespace-nowrap text-xl font-semibold text-[#24e0ff] sm:text-2xl\">5Y</dd></div><div class=\"border-white/15 py-4 pr-5 odd:border-r md:border-r md:last:border-r-0 md:px-5 md:first:pl-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#8a969b]\">local-only bind</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 whitespace-nowrap text-xl font-semibold text-[#24e0ff] sm:text-2xl\">127.0.0.1</dd></div></dl><div data-cstd-page-hero-scroll=\"true\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#748187]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-bounce text-[#f4d431]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->SCROLL / CONTINUE TRACE</div></div></header><section class=\"border-b border-white/12 bg-[#f1eee5] text-[#090b0d]\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1540px] gap-10 px-5 py-14 md:px-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(18rem,0.75fr)_minmax(0,1.25fr)] lg:px-16 lg:py-20\"><div><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#0b5f6d] hover:text-black focus-visible:outline focus-visib